, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "600", "typography_text_transform": "uppercase", "typography_letter_spacing": {"unit": "em", "size": 0.2, "sizes": []}, "typography_line_height": {"unit": "px", "size": 20, "sizes": []}, "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zgal017", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Bătuta, și strigăturile care țin ritmul", "header_size": "h2", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "24", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "24", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "24", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_element_id": "repertoriu-titlu"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zgal018", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Jocul de energie al Moldovei e bătuta. Se joacă în cerc sau în șir, cu pași apăsați în podea, cu bătăi din picior în care tot șirul lovește deodată, și cu strigături. Partea pe care lumea o trece cu vederea e că strigăturile nu sunt doar voie bună: ele țin ritmul. Un șir care lovește deodată are nevoie de un reper auditiv, iar reperul vine din sală, nu de pe scenă.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=quote"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zgal019", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Când ringul dă tempoul, nu scena", "header_size": "h3", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=lead"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "36", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "36", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "36", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zgal01a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Înseamnă că într-un moment de bătută nu conducem noi tempoul, ci îl susținem. Dacă formația forțează, șirul se rupe; dacă rămâne prea în urmă, momentul se stinge. <span class=\"ph\">[angajament de confirmat de client — B77]</span> E singura parte din seară în care urechea instrumentiștilor stă mai mult pe ring decât pe partitură. Restul programului se sprijină pe hore moldovenești, iar aici, spre deosebire de o petrecere din sud, blocul regional nu e un moment dedicat — e materialul obișnuit al serii.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=quote"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zgal01b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><p class=\"mt-8\"><a class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-primary hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px]\" href=\"/repertoriu/\">Vezi repertoriul complet</a></p></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zgal01f", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zgal01e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zgal025", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zgal023", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "width": {"unit": "px", "size": 768, "sizes": []}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "48", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "48", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "32", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "custom_css": "selector{max-width:100%}"}, "elements": [{"id": "zgal020", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Logistică", "header_size": "div", "title_color": "#C6C6C6", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Inter", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 14, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "600", "typography_text_transform": "uppercase", "typography_letter_spacing": {"unit": "em", "size": 0.2, "sizes": []}, "typography_line_height": {"unit": "px", "size": 20, "sizes": []}, "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zgal021", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Două orașe, și un drum bun între ele", "header_size": "h2", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_element_id": "logistica-titlu"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zgal022", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Drumul de la București se face pe DN2 sau pe A2 și DN25, în funcție de capătul județului. Odată ajunși, distanța internă contează: un eveniment la Tecuci și unul la Galați nu pornesc de pe aceeași cifră de transport. Tariful rămâne cel obișnuit: 6 lei pe kilometru, pe traseul dus-întors.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "zgal024", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-gutter max-w-4xl\">\n<div class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant\">Distanță</span>\n<p class=\"font-display-lg text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface\">~220 km din București</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Rămâne de completat, din măsurătoarea unitară aplicată tuturor județelor. Ce se poate spune deja e că cele două rute, prin Brăila sau prin Focșani, nu au aceeași lungime.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant\">Deplasare</span>\n<p class=\"font-headline-md text-xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface\">Echipamentul pleacă înaintea echipei artistice</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Schela, luminile și incintele fac prima cursă, cu tehnicienii; solista și instrumentiștii vin separat, după montaj. Pentru sălile din municipiu se ține cont de traficul dinspre port la orele de după-amiază.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-8 md:col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant\">Cazare</span>\n<p class=\"font-headline-md text-xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface\">Depinde de capătul județului și de oră</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Pentru Galați, la un program obișnuit, întoarcerea se poate face în aceeași noapte. Pentru Tecuci și pentru un final târziu, se discută camerele, iar forma concretă se hotărăște la organizare. <span class=\"ph\">[CAZARE GALAȚI — de confirmat]</span></p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Nu o putem fixa aici, pe pagină: răspunsul vine din combinația oraș plus oră de final.</p>\n</div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zgal027", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zgal026", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zgal029", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zgal028", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-12 text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-5\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\">Pachete</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-2xl md:text-headline-lg leading-tight\" id=\"pachete-titlu\">Ce variază e distanța internă</h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant\">Pachetele sunt cele din grila generală, identice la Galați și la Tecuci. Diferența dintre două oferte din același județ vine din kilometri, nu din componența formației.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Trei tipare diferite, înainte de orice discuție despre kilometri: <a class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/nunta/\">nunta</a>, <a class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/botez/\">botezul</a> și <a class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/eveniment-privat/\">aniversarea în familie</a>. Al patrulea, <a class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/corporate/\">gala de firmă</a>, are propria lui structură.</p>\n<div class=\"motif-rule max-w-[180px] w-full\"><span class=\"motif-rule__gem zona-gem\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto\">\n<a class=\"inline-block text-center whitespace-nowrap bg-accent text-white px-8 md:px-10 py-4 uppercase font-label-md text-label-md tracking-widest hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"/oferte/\">Vezi toate pachetele</a>\n<a class=\"btn-secundar-zona inline-block text-center whitespace-nowrap text-on-surface bg-transparent px-8 md:px-10 py-4 uppercase font-label-md text-label-md tracking-widest hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"/contact/\">Cere ofertă</a>\n</div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zgal02b", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zgal02a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zgal036", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"u